agents plugins update — Update plugins across harnesses

USAGE
  agents plugins update [options]

OPTIONS
  -dry-run
    	dry-run mode
  -f	force mode
  -file string
    	config file (default: $AGENTS_CONFIG, else the user config.toml); - reads stdin
  -force
    	force mode
  -harness string
    	target harness (antigravity, claude, codex, etc.)
  -harness-dir string
    	registry checkout to use instead of the one under the data directory
  -harnesses string
    	comma-separated harnesses to configure (overrides $AGENTS_HARNESSES)
  -json
    	output JSON format
  -n	dry-run mode (inspect only, do not modify)
  -profile string
    	profile to select (overrides $AGENTS_PROFILE and the profile key)
  -h, --help
    Show this help and exit.

DEFAULTS
  Pulls the registry checkout at most once a day (-force always); -n previews changes.

ENVIRONMENT
  AGENTS_CONFIG: config file; AGENTS_PROFILE: profile; AGENTS_HARNESSES: harnesses; XDG_CONFIG_HOME (Windows APPDATA): config directory. XDG_DATA_HOME (Windows LOCALAPPDATA): registry checkouts.

EXAMPLES
  agents plugins update -n
